+         disc that has already scrolled off, so it is the one thing on this screen that stays pinned.
+         GONE for everything that is not a multi-disc album, and then it collapses to a point at
+         spv's bottom, so the list keeps the full height. -->
+    <TextView android:textSize="10.0sp" android:textStyle="bold" android:textColor="#FF3CFFDE" android:gravity="start|center" android:id="@id/ipp_disc_bar" android:visibility="gone" android:layout_width="fill_parent" android:layout_height="16.0dip" app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/spv" />
