+         (64x64) and drawn at its own size, so a theme whose 2.png is taller than the row makes this
+         wrap_content view — and with it the whole wrap_content row — grow: "Frutiger Aero" ships a
+         64x63 arrow against a 60px row, and since itemSetRightArrow is called only in the FOCUSED
+         branch, the row under the cursor came out 63 while its neighbours stayed 60.
